    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1158-a4">

                <pb facs="1237" n="1141" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1141"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ciudad Bolivar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-05-12"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Gen. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ignacio Andrade</hi>,
                        etc.,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Caracas:</hi></p>
                <p>I am awaiting an opportune moment to send to the national government the result
                    of the investigations as to the complicity of the American, Felipe Scandella,
                    with the revolutionists of this section. From the testimony taken at the
                    investigation <pb facs="1238" n="1142" xml:id="pg1142"/> his complicity has been
                    proved, and I have therefore notified said Scandella, through the magistrate of
                    this district, that he must leave the State until order is established.</p>
                <p>Your friend,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ernesto Garcia</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>True copy.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Contasti Laveaux.</hi>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
